{
 "_doc": "Surtr, boss (GAME_DESIGN.md: Midgard's Edge bosses; art 10/31/2026). Built by tools/art/build_boss_surtr.py; rules in docs/ART_RULES.md. From the Poetic Edda, Voluspa 52 (Surtr comes from the south with the bane of branches, fire; the sun shines from his sword) and Snorri Sturluson's Prose Edda, Gylfaginning 4 (the giant who guards Muspell, the land of fire, with a flaming sword) and 51 (at Ragnarok fire burns before and behind him, and light shines from his sword brighter than the sun). A huge fire giant: skin like coal with embers glowing through the cracks, hair and beard of flame, a soot-dark leather kilt, the blazing sword raised. As big as Kronos (a giant).",
